{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-9008cbf8580a2f7781c4","clause_number":"10.8.1","title":"10.8.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin：（88/3/1、110/7/1）","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":249,"pdf_page_end":249,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007519","raw_text":"10.8.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin：（88/3/1、110/7/1）","display_text":"10.8.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin：（88/3/1、110/7/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6520]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007520","raw_text":"10.8.1.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin注射劑：(88/3/1、110/7/1)","display_text":"10.8.1.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin注射劑：(88/3/1、110/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6521]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007521","raw_text":"1.對其他抗生素有抗藥性之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","display_text":"1.對其他抗生素有抗藥性之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6522]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007522","raw_text":"2.病患對其他抗生素有嚴重過敏反應之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","display_text":"2.病患對其他抗生素有嚴重過敏反應之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6523]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007523","raw_text":"3.治療抗生素引起之腸炎(antibiotics-associated colitis)，經使用metronidazole無效者始可使用口服vancomycin。","display_text":"3.治療抗生素引起之腸炎(antibiotics-associated colitis)，經使用metronidazole無效者始可使用口服vancomycin。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6524]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007524","raw_text":"4.vancomycin 10 gm(溶液用粉劑)限骨髓移植病例使用。","display_text":"4.vancomycin 10 gm(溶液用粉劑)限骨髓移植病例使用。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6525]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007525","raw_text":"5.其他經感染症專科醫師認定需使用者。","display_text":"5.其他經感染症專科醫師認定需使用者。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6526]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007526","raw_text":"10.8.1.2.Vancomycin口服製劑(110/7/1)","display_text":"10.8.1.2.Vancomycin口服製劑(110/7/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6527]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007527","raw_text":"1.\t限用於梭狀桿菌引起之假膜性結腸炎，且需符合下列診斷方法之一：","display_text":"1.\t限用於梭狀桿菌引起之假膜性結腸炎，且需符合下列診斷方法之一：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6528]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007528","raw_text":"(1)內視鏡檢查證實有假膜性結腸炎之病理變化。","display_text":"(1)內視鏡檢查證實有假膜性結腸炎之病理變化。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6529]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007529","raw_text":"(2)臨床上有腸炎、結腸炎之相關症狀，如腹瀉、腹痛、腸阻塞(ileus)等，加上下列任一種條件：","display_text":"(2)臨床上有腸炎、結腸炎之相關症狀，如腹瀉、腹痛、腸阻塞(ileus)等，加上下列任一種條件：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6530]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007530","raw_text":"I.糞便檢驗證實有梭狀桿菌之toxin A或toxin B存在、或其毒素基因存在。","display_text":"I.糞便檢驗證實有梭狀桿菌之toxin A或toxin B存在、或其毒素基因存在。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6531]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007531","raw_text":"II.糞便細菌培養證實有梭狀桿菌或糞便之抗原檢測證實有GDH(glutamate dehydrogenase)存在。","display_text":"II.糞便細菌培養證實有梭狀桿菌或糞便之抗原檢測證實有GDH(glutamate dehydrogenase)存在。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6532]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007532","raw_text":"2.\t申報時應檢附下列報告之一：","display_text":"2.\t申報時應檢附下列報告之一：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6533]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007533","raw_text":"(1)內視鏡檢查報告。","display_text":"(1)內視鏡檢查報告。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6534]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007534","raw_text":"(2)臨床症狀敘述，加上Toxin A+B檢測報告、糞便細菌培養結果、糞便細菌抗原檢測(GDH)結果或PCR基因檢測結果。","display_text":"(2)臨床症狀敘述，加上Toxin A+B檢測報告、糞便細菌培養結果、糞便細菌抗原檢測(GDH)結果或PCR基因檢測結果。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6535]"}],"ancestors":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007089","raw_text":"第10節 抗微生物劑 Antimicrobial agents","display_text":"第10節 抗微生物劑 Antimicrobial agents","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6090]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007518","raw_text":"10.8.其他  Miscellaneous","display_text":"10.8.其他  Miscellaneous","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6519]"}],"nested_tables":{},"references":[],"missing_source_paragraphs":[],"original_nodes":[{"clause_id":"PAY-9008cbf8580a2f7781c4","clause_number":"10.8.1","parent_clause_id":"PAY-739cac0757cccbb537aa","original_text":"10.8.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin：（88/3/1、110/7/1）","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007519"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","clause_number":"10.8.1.1","parent_clause_id":"PAY-9008cbf8580a2f7781c4","original_text":"10.8.1.1.Teicoplanin及vancomycin注射劑：(88/3/1、110/7/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007520"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-34e13729d1ba618f954e","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","original_text":"1.對其他抗生素有抗藥性之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007521"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-c60a6ce178edc499ea34","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","original_text":"2.病患對其他抗生素有嚴重過敏反應之革蘭氏陽性菌感染。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007522"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-4bd60a0593c15f2e8dae","clause_number":"3.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","original_text":"3.治療抗生素引起之腸炎(antibiotics-associated colitis)，經使用metronidazole無效者始可使用口服vancomycin。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007523"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-00c4829774b9091567b5","clause_number":"4.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","original_text":"4.vancomycin 10 gm(溶液用粉劑)限骨髓移植病例使用。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007524"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-ff1490aa225e1a8e5c84","clause_number":"5.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-af24a02bc335e0b8228f","original_text":"5.其他經感染症專科醫師認定需使用者。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007525"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-c0fb94044ee51cb1338a","clause_number":"10.8.1.2","parent_clause_id":"PAY-9008cbf8580a2f7781c4","original_text":"10.8.1.2.Vancomycin口服製劑(110/7/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007526"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-ae587af38e1b6b6dfaa4","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-c0fb94044ee51cb1338a","original_text":"1.\t限用於梭狀桿菌引起之假膜性結腸炎，且需符合下列診斷方法之一：","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007527"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-51ec8c2154880ab3274a","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-ae587af38e1b6b6dfaa4","original_text":"(1)內視鏡檢查證實有假膜性結腸炎之病理變化。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007528"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-7ddbca85a8fb076bb06c","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-ae587af38e1b6b6dfaa4","original_text":"(2)臨床上有腸炎、結腸炎之相關症狀，如腹瀉、腹痛、腸阻塞(ileus)等，加上下列任一種條件：","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007529"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-e59b81e45b8d03ae319c","clause_number":"I.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-7ddbca85a8fb076bb06c","original_text":"I.糞便檢驗證實有梭狀桿菌之toxin A或toxin B存在、或其毒素基因存在。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007530"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-2e71ada0018771032b88","clause_number":"II.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-7ddbca85a8fb076bb06c","original_text":"II.糞便細菌培養證實有梭狀桿菌或糞便之抗原檢測證實有GDH(glutamate dehydrogenase)存在。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007531"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-a0d93038d4178df68f2a","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-c0fb94044ee51cb1338a","original_text":"2.\t申報時應檢附下列報告之一：","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007532"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-ed7b15fca88cd0c98648","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-a0d93038d4178df68f2a","original_text":"(1)內視鏡檢查報告。","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007533"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-3a4c7904b4e8813f77e5","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-a0d93038d4178df68f2a","original_text":"(2)臨床症狀敘述，加上Toxin A+B檢測報告、糞便細菌培養結果、糞便細菌抗原檢測(GDH)結果或PCR基因檢測結果。"